<title>USA: Quintel Q1 shr $0.29 vs $0.28 after credit.</title>
<headline>Quintel Q1 shr $0.29 vs $0.28 after credit.</headline>
<dateline>PEARL RIVER, N.Y. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.29		    $0.28</p>
<p> Net		 5,435		    4,302</p>
<p> Revs		44,060		   16,018</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary18,776		   15,446</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share for the quarter ended Feb 22, 1996 included a non-recurring tax benefit of $0.12 related to the change in the company's tax status as a result of its converting to a &quot;C&quot; corporation upon the company's initial public offering. Without the related tax benefit, earnings per share for the fiscal 1996 first quarter would have been $0.16.</p>
